  "sourceText": "Beet & Green Apple Smoothie\nBy: Zomppa\nPublished: Wednesday, March 30, 2011 - 5:08am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n5 carrots\n1 small beet (including the leaves)\nA couple stalks of celery\nA handful of kale\nA handful of spinach\n1 green apple\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix 2 Drink within 20 minutes of juicing.\n\nAbout\n\n\nPrescription for Health: Beet & Green Apple Smoothie on #TheIRONIC http://www.zomppa.com/?p=12096",
